# Local env files must never be uploaded as deployment source -- Vercel CLI
# does not exclude gitignored files by default the way `git` does, so these
# were previously shipping local secrets (and a hardcoded localhost
# NEXTAUTH_URL) to every production build. Real env vars for deployments
# live in the Vercel dashboard/CLI (`vercel env`), not in these files.
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
.env.bak*
